<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>English Placement Assessment</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#F3F0E7;
    --paper-2:#EDE9DC;
    --ink:#1E2A24;
    --ink-soft:#4B564F;
    --rule:#C9C2AE;
    --pine:#2F5D50;
    --pine-dark:#1F4038;
    --gold:#C99A2E;
    --brick:#A23B3B;
    --white:#FCFBF7;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.55;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:0;
  }
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;}

  /* ---------- Layout shell ---------- */
  .shell{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){
    .shell{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }

  /* ---------- Side tab index ---------- */
  .index{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    align-self:start;
    height:100vh;
    padding:28px 0 28px 8px;
    border-right:1px solid var(--rule);
    overflow-y:auto;
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){
    .index{
      position:static;
      height:auto;
      display:flex;
      overflow-x:auto;
      border-right:none;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
      padding:14px 12px;
      gap:6px;
    }
  }
  .index-brand{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    padding:0 18px 16px 18px;
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){ .index-brand{display:none;} }
  .tab{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    padding:11px 16px 11px 18px;
    border-left:3px solid transparent;
    text-decoration:none;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:14.5px;
    white-space:nowrap;
    transition:background .15s ease, color .15s ease, border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .tab:hover{background:var(--paper-2);}
  .tab .num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--rule);
    min-width:18px;
  }
  .tab.active{
    border-left-color:var(--pine);
    color:var(--pine-dark);
    background:var(--paper-2);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .tab.active .num{color:var(--pine);}

  /* ---------- Main column ---------- */
  main{padding:0 0 80px 0;}

  .topbar{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:5;
    background:rgba(243,240,231,.9);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
    padding:14px 40px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:16px;
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){ .topbar{padding:12px 20px;} }
  .progress-pill{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--pine-dark);
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:6px 14px;
  }
  .print-btn{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.04em;
    background:var(--pine);
    color:var(--white);
    border:none;
    border-radius:6px;
    padding:8px 16px;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .print-btn:hover{background:var(--pine-dark);}

  section{
    padding:56px 40px 20px 48px;
    max-width:820px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){ section{padding:40px 20px 10px 24px;} }
  section:last-of-type{border-bottom:none;}

  .cover{
    padding:64px 48px 40px 48px;
    max-width:820px;
  }
  .cover .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--pine);
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .cover h1{
    font-size:42px;
    line-height:1.08;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){ .cover h1{font-size:32px;} }
  .cover .lede{
    font-size:17px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    max-width:60ch;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .cover .field-row{
    display:flex;
    gap:28px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-top:30px;
  }
  .field{min-width:200px;flex:1;}
  .field label{
    display:block;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .field input{
    width:100%;
    border:none;
    border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink);
    background:transparent;
    font-family:'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    padding:6px 2px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .field input:focus{outline:none;border-bottom-color:var(--pine);}

  .sec-head{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    gap:14px;
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .sec-head .tag{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:13px;
    color:var(--pine);
    border:1px solid var(--pine);
    border-radius:4px;
    padding:2px 8px;
  }
  .sec-head h2{font-size:27px;}
  .sec-sub{
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:15px;
    margin:8px 0 30px 0;
    max-width:65ch;
  }

  .q{
    margin-bottom:26px;
    padding-bottom:22px;
    border-bottom:1px dashed var(--rule);
  }
  .q:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .q-num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    color:var(--pine);
    font-weight:600;
    margin-right:8px;
  }
  .q-prompt{font-size:16px;}
  .q-type{
    display:inline-block;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:.05em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    background:var(--paper-2);
    border-radius:3px;
    padding:2px 7px;
    margin-left:8px;
    vertical-align:middle;
  }

  /* answer widgets */
  .ruled{
    width:100%;
    border:none;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(var(--paper) 0 31px, var(--rule) 31px 32px);
    background-position:0 8px;
    font-family:'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size:15.5px;
    line-height:32px;
    padding:8px 4px 4px 4px;
    color:var(--ink);
    resize:vertical;
    margin-top:12px;
  }
  .ruled:focus{outline:none;}
  .ruled.short{height:70px;}
  .ruled.med{height:96px;}
  .ruled.long{height:128px;}

  .blank-input{
    border:none;
    border-bottom:2px dotted var(--ink-soft);
    background:transparent;
    font-family:'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    padding:2px 6px;
    min-width:150px;
    color:var(--pine-dark);
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .blank-input:focus{outline:none;border-bottom-color:var(--pine);}

  .choices{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
    margin-top:14px;
  }
  .choice{
    font-family:'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
    font-size:15px;
    background:var(--white);
    border:1.5px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:9px 16px;
    cursor:pointer;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    transition:border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  }
  .choice .letter{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    border:1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius:50%;
    width:20px;height:20px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .choice:hover{border-color:var(--pine);}
  .choice.selected{
    border-color:var(--pine);
    background:#E7EFE9;
  }
  .choice.selected .letter{
    background:var(--pine);
    border-color:var(--pine);
    color:var(--white);
  }

  /* picture placeholder */
  .img-box{
    border:2px dashed var(--rule);
    border-radius:10px;
    background:var(--white);
    height:280px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:8px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom:22px;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
  }
  .img-box .icon{font-size:30px;}
  .img-box .cap{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:.03em;
  }
  .img-title{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--pine);
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }

  .passage{
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:26px 28px;
    font-size:15.8px;
    line-height:1.75;
    margin-bottom:30px;
  }
  .passage h3{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;}

  .scenario-card{
    background:var(--white);
    border:1px solid var(--rule);
    border-left:4px solid var(--pine);
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:20px 22px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .scenario-card h3{
    font-size:17px;
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .scenario-card p{margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  footer{
    max-width:820px;
    padding:30px 40px 60px 48px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:13px;
  }

  /* ---------- Print ---------- */
  @media print{
    .index, .topbar{display:none !important;}
    .shell{display:block;}
    body{background:#fff;}
    section{
      break-inside:avoid-page;
      page-break-after:always;
      border-bottom:none;
      padding:26px 6px;
    }
    .cover{padding:20px 6px;}
    .choice{border:1.2px solid #999;}
    .choice.selected{background:#eee;}
    .img-box{height:220px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="shell">
  <nav class="index" id="index">
    <div class="index-brand">Placement&nbsp;Workbook</div>
    <a class="tab" data-target="welcome"><span class="num">00</span>Welcome</a>
    <a class="tab" data-target="conversation"><span class="num">01</span>Conversation</a>
    <a class="tab" data-target="pictures"><span class="num">02</span>Picture Description</a>
    <a class="tab" data-target="reading"><span class="num">03</span>Reading</a>
    <a class="tab" data-target="grammar"><span class="num">04</span>Grammar</a>
    <a class="tab" data-target="roleplay"><span class="num">05</span>Role Play</a>
    <a class="tab" data-target="discussion"><span class="num">06</span>Discussion</a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <div class="topbar">
      <span class="progress-pill" id="progressPill">0 of 0 answered</span>
      <button class="print-btn" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save PDF</button>
    </div>

    <section class="cover" id="welcome">
      <div class="eyebrow">English Placement Assessment</div>
      <h1>Let's find out where your<br>English stands today.</h1>
      <p class="lede">This assessment helps us understand your current English level so we can place you in the right class. There's no need to prepare — just answer as naturally as you can, the way you would in everyday conversation. It takes about 30&ndash;40 minutes and covers speaking topics, a short reading passage, grammar, role-play scenarios, and discussion questions.</p>
      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field"><label>Full Name</label><input type="text" placeholder="Your name"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Date</label><input type="text" placeholder="DD / MM / YYYY"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Native Language</label><input type="text" placeholder="Your first language"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ SECTION 1: CONVERSATION ============ -->
    <section id="conversation">
      <div class="sec-head"><span class="tag">01</span><h2>Conversation</h2></div>
      <p class="sec-sub">Answer each question out loud or in writing. The questions get a little more challenging as you go.</p>

      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">1.</span><span class="q-prompt">What is your full name, and what would you like me to call you?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled short"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">2.</span><span class="q-prompt">Where are you from, and how long have you lived in Canada?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled short"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">3.</span><span class="q-prompt">Can you tell me a little about your family?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled short"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">4.</span><span class="q-prompt">What do you do for work, or what kind of job are you looking for?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled short"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">5.</span><span class="q-prompt">Can you describe a typical day in your life?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled med"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">6.</span><span class="q-prompt">What do you usually do in your free time?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled short"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">7.</span><span class="q-prompt">What is something you have accomplished that you're proud of?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled med"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">8.</span><span class="q-prompt">Have you traveled to any other countries? What was that experience like?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled med"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">9.</span><span class="q-prompt">What has been the biggest adjustment for you since moving to Canada?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled med"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">10.</span><span class="q-prompt">Why did you decide to learn English, and how do you usually practice it?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled med"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">11.</span><span class="q-prompt">What is the most challenging part of learning English for you so far?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled med"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">12.</span><span class="q-prompt">Where do you hope to be, personally or professionally, in the next five years?</span>
        <textarea class="ruled long"></textarea></div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ SECTION 2: PICTURE DESCRIPTION ============ -->
    <section id="pictures">
      <div class="sec-head"><span class="tag">02</span><h2>Picture Description</h2></div>
      <p class="sec-sub">For each image, look carefully and answer all six questions below it. Add your own photo or illustration to each box before the lesson if you'd like a visual prompt.</p>

      <div class="img-title">Image 1 &middot; Busy City Park</div>
      <div class="img-box"><div class="icon">&#128196;</div><div class="cap">Insert photo or illustration here<br>(families picnicking, children playing soccer, food truck, pond with ducks&hellip;)</div></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">1.</span><span class="q-prompt">Describe everything you can see.</span><textarea class="ruled med"></textarea></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">2.</span><span class="q-prompt">What are the people doing?</span><textarea class="ruled short"></textarea></div>
