      <div class="q"><span class="q-num">6.</span><span class="q-prompt">If you were in this picture, what would you be doing?</span><textarea class="ruled short"></textarea></div>

      <div class="img-title" style="margin-top:36px;">Image 2 &middot; Airport Departure Hall</div>
      <div class="img-box"><div class="icon">&#128196;</div><div class="cap">Insert photo or illustration here<br>(check-in line, family saying goodbye, security, departure board&hellip;)</div></div>
