      <div class="img-title" style="margin-top:36px;">Image 4 &middot; Family Dinner</div>
      <div class="img-box"><div class="icon">&#128196;</div><div class="cap">Insert photo or illustration here<br>(grandparents, birthday cake, balloons, a spilled cup of juice&hellip;)</div></div>
