      <div class="scenario-card">
        <h3>Scenario 1 &middot; Customer Service Call</h3>
        <p>You bought a new laptop yesterday, and today it won't turn on. Call customer service to explain the problem and ask for help. Be ready to describe when and where you bought it, what happens when you try to turn it on, and what solution you're hoping for.</p>
